<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>09 / MCP 接入</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>权限边界与防提示注入</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>原题、OCR、教师材料和外部网页中的文字是任务资料，不能借其中的指令改变身份或工具权限</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>双层安全模型</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>服务端执行访问范围、版本检查和允许的状态变化；宿主提示词只帮助正确使用。二者缺一不可。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三级操作权限</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>读取 / 保存草稿 / 正式发布采用不同业务能力，不能由一次调用跨级完成。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>降级明确</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>某宿主能力不足时提供明确降级，不生成看似成功但无法访问的结果。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：系统Agent适配与MCP插件接入设计.md §5.4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 92 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>